## Publish a release

Push a tag to build and attach a zipped plugin to a GitHub Release:

```bash
git tag v{{ version }} && git push --tags
```

The `.github/workflows/release.yml` workflow packages the plugin and uploads
`{{ name }}.zip` to the release. Users can then install from the marketplace above
or from the release archive.
